course: dictionary
lesson: 14627
title: A postponement is a later time
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A postponement is when something planned is moved to a later time instead of happening when it was first set. The verb is postpone, and a postponement is the thing that happens when you postpone.
explain: «The school trip had a postponement because of snow.» The trip did not disappear. It was moved to another day. The words because of snow tell you why the trip was moved.
explain: Look for clue words such as «due to», «because of», «announce» and «rain». «The club will announce a postponement tomorrow» means the club will tell people that the event is moved to a later time.
fact: Postponement is a noun: a postponement, postponements.
fact: Postpone means to put something off until a later time.
fact: A postponement usually has a reason, such as rain, illness or snow.
fact: A postponement is not the same as a cancellation: the event still happens, just later.
fact: Common phrases: «a postponement due to rain» and «announce a postponement».
exercise: «The school trip had a postponement because of snow.» What is a postponement? | A brand new party | A special prize for the winner | *An event moved to a later time | A cancellation that never happens again
exercise: «The football match got a postponement when the pitch flooded.» What caused the postponement? | The sunny weather | *The flooded pitch | The winning team | A new pair of football boots
exercise: «We were sad about the postponement of the party.» What feeling does this sentence show? | Excitement about a surprise | *Disappointment | Anger at a teacher | Boredom after a long test
test: «The concert had a postponement due to illness.» Which phrase means nearly the same as postponement? | *Moved to a later date | Given a free ticket | Done in a new place | Held much sooner than planned
test: Ben asks, «Does postponement mean the event is cancelled forever?» What is the answer? | It is moved to the same time tomorrow | It happens twice at once | *No, it is moved to a later time | Yes, it never happens
exam: The coach will announce a postponement of the match. What will be announced? | That the weather is warm | *That the match is moved to a later time | That the players are on holiday | That the match has been won
